</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_standardhierarchicalsection" id="_standardhierarchicalsection"></a><h2>7.10<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardHierarchicalSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_01c8321e-cbd0-4403-b0e6-a1ef9b56eb63" id="_01c8321e-cbd0-4403-b0e6-a1ef9b56eb63"></a>A hierarchical section containing other sections, within a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 13&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardHierarchicalSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_6bdb66b3-c7ef-4baf-a2f9-887e45c8ebb9" id="_6bdb66b3-c7ef-4baf-a2f9-887e45c8ebb9"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">subsections</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Subclauses of the section.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>StandardSection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_clausesection" id="_clausesection"></a><h2>7.11<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ClauseSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_682d3d0e-3d0c-4a51-8d03-30475b4b7b58" id="_682d3d0e-3d0c-4a51-8d03-30475b4b7b58"></a>A numbered clause constituting part of the main body of a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 14&#xA0;&#x2014; ClauseSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_028f2ffa-eb07-4807-a524-7b3bfe0f0b4d" id="_028f2ffa-eb07-4807-a524-7b3bfe0f0b4d"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">type</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Semantic class of the numbered clause.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>String</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_annexsection" id="_annexsection"></a><h2>7.12<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>AnnexSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_977205b3-e4ca-407f-80be-45ae4c77abbd" id="_977205b3-e4ca-407f-80be-45ae4c77abbd"></a>Section of document constituting an annex or appendix.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 15&#xA0;&#x2014; AnnexSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_979e5731-0e18-4854-98b7-5a121ca229d0" id="_979e5731-0e18-4854-98b7-5a121ca229d0"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">subsections</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Subsections of the annex. Added explicitly because AnnexSection permits hanging paragraphs
(top-level blocks are included in the section alongside subsections).</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ClauseSection</tt>
