        <div><a name="_clausehierarchicalsection" id="_clausehierarchicalsection"></a><h2>7.14<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>ClauseHierarchicalSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_32fc23ca-5007-4f5d-9d33-1c20a71b9a83" id="_32fc23ca-5007-4f5d-9d33-1c20a71b9a83"></a>Clauses in which all textual content belongs in a strict clause hierarchy. such that no blocks of text
