 1.5pt;">Subclauses which are mutually exclusive with text content.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ClauseHierarchicalSection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_standardcontentsection" id="_standardcontentsection"></a><h2>7.15<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardContentSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_80bbcba2-b7b6-4be3-ae3c-c947846391de" id="_80bbcba2-b7b6-4be3-ae3c-c947846391de"></a>An unnumbered clause, outside the main body of text of a <i>StandardDocument</i>.</p>
