      </div>
      <div><a name="standardsreferencessection" id="standardsreferencessection"></a>
        <h1>8<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Citation and reference elements</h1>
        <div><a name="_purpose_3" id="_purpose_3"></a><h2>8.1<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Purpose</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1da7aec3-131a-4ec2-a1e5-608afebc3a84" id="_1da7aec3-131a-4ec2-a1e5-608afebc3a84"></a>Standardization documents often cite other documents within,
and as a result they usually contain one or more bibliography sections
indicating its data sources. Bibliography sections may be differentiated
as being normative or informative.</p>
</div>
        <div><a name="_standardreferencessection_2" id="_standardreferencessection_2"></a><h2>8.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardReferencesSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_12b909b1-7261-4bd3-baf9-1b82f91fd68b" id="_12b909b1-7261-4bd3-baf9-1b82f91fd68b"></a>The <tt>StandardReferencesSection</tt> class within <i>StandardDocument</i>
is used to represent a bibliography section.
It is used to collate references within the document, where
there could be one or more of such sections within a document.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_585e4ad5-bb61-41b1-b1b8-b46bd6595d3c" id="_585e4ad5-bb61-41b1-b1b8-b46bd6595d3c"></a>For example, some standardization documents differentiate
normative or informative references, some split references into
sections organized by concept relevance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_70ef0ee4-306f-4b02-9c2c-0ec1991d3060" id="_70ef0ee4-306f-4b02-9c2c-0ec1991d3060"></a>Similar to the <tt>ReferencesSection</tt> of the <i>BasicDocument</i> model,
they are leaf nodes which contain zero or more
bibliographical references (as modelled in Relaton), along with
any prefatory text.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 20&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardReferencesSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_157194e4-4511-4571-b62c-c9e410acd314" id="_157194e4-4511-4571-b62c-c9e410acd314"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">normative</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Whether the references in the current section are normative or informative for the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>Boolean</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">references</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Bibliographic items cited in the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>BibliographicItem</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">note</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Annotations accompanying bibliographic items.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ParagraphBlock</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_standardreferencessection_3" id="_standardreferencessection_3"></a><h2>8.3<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>StandardReferencesSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_95c233ae-1088-44a9-8310-fe9475a531d3" id="_95c233ae-1088-44a9-8310-fe9475a531d3"></a>The <tt>StandardReferencesSection</tt> class within <i>StandardDocument</i>
is used to represent a bibliography section.
It is used to collate references within the document, where
there could be one or more of such sections within a document.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8f81cdd1-2c15-4a97-9dff-46d4d004a1e4" id="_8f81cdd1-2c15-4a97-9dff-46d4d004a1e4"></a>For example, some standardization documents differentiate
normative or informative references, some split references into
sections organized by concept relevance.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e3b3a32f-6157-4b10-83e0-9edb5b946b1e" id="_e3b3a32f-6157-4b10-83e0-9edb5b946b1e"></a>Similar to the <tt>ReferencesSection</tt> of the <i>BasicDocument</i> model,
they are leaf nodes which contain zero or more
bibliographical references (as modelled in Relaton), along with
any prefatory text.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 21&#xA0;&#x2014; StandardReferencesSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_c43f5260-8a22-478c-a14a-922e8f832af8" id="_c43f5260-8a22-478c-a14a-922e8f832af8"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">normative</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Whether the references in the current section are normative or informative for the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>Boolean</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">references</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">Bibliographic items cited in the document.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">
<tt>BibliographicItem</tt>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">note</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Annotations accompanying bibliographic items.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>ParagraphBlock</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_reference_item" id="_reference_item"></a><h2>8.4<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Reference item</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8b9cc3a9-e241-416a-8891-f8342edae443" id="_8b9cc3a9-e241-416a-8891-f8342edae443"></a>Each reference item is represented using the <tt>BibliographicItem</tt>
class defined in <a href="#relaton">CC 6900</a>.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_998421de-4cfb-4aea-a99b-71f43b710649" id="_998421de-4cfb-4aea-a99b-71f43b710649"></a>It is not necessary to specialize reference items amongst
documents from different standardization bodies as a document
can cite documents of any type.</p></div>
        <div><a name="_citation" id="_citation"></a><h2>8.5<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Citation</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a82dca02-76b1-436d-ba95-ad92d62ea4f6" id="_a82dca02-76b1-436d-ba95-ad92d62ea4f6"></a>Each citation is represented by the <tt>Citation</tt> class defined in
<a href="#relaton">CC 6900</a>.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_95f4d54c-7ec7-4ce7-987d-0d2d4158dcd3" id="_95f4d54c-7ec7-4ce7-987d-0d2d4158dcd3"></a>It is not necessary to specialize citations since it is simply
a document data element reference linked to a reference item.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div><a name="terms" id="terms"></a>
        <h1>9<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Terms and definition elements</h1>
        <div><a name="_purpose_4" id="_purpose_4"></a><h2>9.1<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Purpose</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d164f445-e754-4eb9-913c-95a799e88d52" id="_d164f445-e754-4eb9-913c-95a799e88d52"></a>Standardization documents are used to convey normative information;
to achieve so it is imperative to provide a standardized set of
terms and definitions.</p>
</div>
        <div><a name="_general_3" id="_general_3"></a><h2>9.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>General</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_11f0a068-075c-4992-a7e7-cfd6f9e40e79" id="_11f0a068-075c-4992-a7e7-cfd6f9e40e79"></a>The <i>StandardDocument</i> model provides two further subclasses of
clause sections (<tt>ClauseSection</tt>):</p>

<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo21;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
Definition section, and
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo21;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
Term section.
</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_1e8c9cd1-5503-459c-81f3-ed008d2735c8" id="_1e8c9cd1-5503-459c-81f3-ed008d2735c8"></a>Both types of section can include prefatory text.</p></div>
        <div><a name="_definitionsection" id="_definitionsection"></a><h2>9.3<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>DefinitionSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a3c40cbf-8db5-449c-9c01-6732476e7c5a" id="_a3c40cbf-8db5-449c-9c01-6732476e7c5a"></a>Definition sections consist of one or more definition lists (<tt>DefinitionCollection</tt>),
are used to define symbols and
abbreviations used in the remainder of the document.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_84299441-bced-4837-a0a1-2c7e055e116f" id="_84299441-bced-4837-a0a1-2c7e055e116f"></a>They can also be used as glossaries, with simple definitions,
in contrast to the more elaborate definitions given in
terms sections.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_895ed351-1b8d-4e75-96c9-e04d9ba1df76" id="_895ed351-1b8d-4e75-96c9-e04d9ba1df76"></a>In addition to allowing prefatory text per section, each definition list
within each definition section can also be preceded by prefatory text.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 22&#xA0;&#x2014; DefinitionSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_2a215ef3-eb13-4ae5-b39a-c69c49d18570" id="_2a215ef3-eb13-4ae5-b39a-c69c49d18570"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">definitions</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition list.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">M</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>DefinitionCollection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_definitioncollection" id="_definitioncollection"></a><h2>9.4<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>DefinitionCollection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_527f5ca4-e486-4a7b-acbf-2c94edba223f" id="_527f5ca4-e486-4a7b-acbf-2c94edba223f"></a>Collection of definitions, constituting the core content of a DefinitionSection.</p>
<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 23&#xA0;&#x2014; DefinitionCollection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_0f939bbf-2b66-4d2d-8407-31d8bc352003" id="_0f939bbf-2b66-4d2d-8407-31d8bc352003"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">definitions</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Individual definition.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">O</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">N</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>Definition</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_definition" id="_definition"></a><h2>9.5<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Definition</h2>

</div>
        <div><a name="_termssection" id="_termssection"></a><h2>9.6<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>TermsSection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_bfb94017-f458-4d49-bd61-002b84650500" id="_bfb94017-f458-4d49-bd61-002b84650500"></a>Term sections (<tt>TermsSection</tt>) give elaborated definitions of terms used in
a standardization document.</p><div class="Note"><a name="_7b45cf61-d466-4a5d-9923-a841b7c075e3" id="_7b45cf61-d466-4a5d-9923-a841b7c075e3"></a><p class="Note"><span class="note_label">NOTE</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>The <tt>TermsSection</tt> definition fully aligns with the structure
and requirements of the &#x201C;Terms and definition&#x201D; section given in
ISO/IEC DIR 2.</p></div>

<p class="Tabletitle" style="text-align:center;">Table 24&#xA0;&#x2014; TermsSection attributes</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_7ec0c3f8-bf57-4186-a0bf-78ef9a922523" id="_7ec0c3f8-bf57-4186-a0bf-78ef9a922523"></a><thead><tr><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Name</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Definition</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Mandatory/ Optional/ Conditional</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Max Occur</th><th valign="middle" align="center" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Data Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">terms</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">Terms defined in the term section.</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">M</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">1</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">
<tt>TermCollection</tt>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
        <div><a name="_termcollection" id="_termcollection"></a><h2>9.7<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>TermCollection</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a627088e-6dd3-415a-a0de-3fa4331a787b" id="_a627088e-6dd3-415a-a0de-3fa4331a787b"></a>A collection of terms, constituting the main body of a Terms Section.</p>
