        <div><a name="_relatedtermtype" id="_relatedtermtype"></a><h2>9.10<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>RelatedTermType</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_3566a336-488f-4c30-8776-02265a803523" id="_3566a336-488f-4c30-8776-02265a803523"></a>Type of relation between terms.</p>
