        <div><a name="_nested_sections" id="_nested_sections"></a><h2>9.13<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Nested sections</h2><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fbe0da94-bdad-44ab-9607-1733d22e051d" id="_fbe0da94-bdad-44ab-9607-1733d22e051d"></a>Both definition and term sections are leaf nodes, and cannot
contain subclauses of their own.</p>
